WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.583
Teacher isn't here...

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:08.041
Where are we? We don't have our weapons!

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:10.250
Krad! Gennel!

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.625
Where is everyone?

00:00:16.332 --> 00:00:17.542
It's huge!

00:00:17.542 --> 00:00:20.082
This... This is bad!

00:00:20.082 --> 00:00:23.957
Without Teacher, I can't use magic or skills...

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.500
I can't fight...

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.292
Victor!

00:00:33.292 --> 00:00:34.207
A trap!

00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:46.292
A kind of monster capable of altering traps...

00:00:46.292 --> 00:00:48.542
A Trickster Spider?

00:00:48.542 --> 00:00:49.750
I'm afraid it is likely so.

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.000
Impossible.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.875
Did it just happen to evolve?

00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:56.375
Or perhaps someone
deliberately made this happen...

00:00:56.375 --> 00:00:57.542
What do you mean?

00:00:57.542 --> 00:01:00.332
No, it's nothing.

00:01:00.332 --> 00:01:04.250
In any case, this is an irregular situation.

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.167
It wouldn't be a surprise
even if a Trickster Spider is behind this.

00:01:09.332 --> 00:01:11.750
Those guys didn't have their weapons
with them when they were teleported!

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:13.832
We need to get to them fast!

00:01:13.832 --> 00:01:15.457
You're right. We must hurry.

00:01:15.457 --> 00:01:17.292
We need to be efficient.

00:01:17.292 --> 00:01:20.000
Let's split up into three groups.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.792
Eiselle and I will team up with Krad's party.

00:01:22.792 --> 00:01:24.207
Got it.

00:01:24.207 --> 00:01:26.292
I still have some antidotes on me.

00:01:26.292 --> 00:01:28.332
Rig will join the Forest Eyes.

00:01:28.332 --> 00:01:29.875
I look forward to working with you all.

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:31.375
- Yes.
- All right.

00:01:31.375 --> 00:01:33.957
We'll have to ask Miss Amanda to go solo.

00:01:33.957 --> 00:01:34.957
Okay.

00:01:35.792 --> 00:01:40.250
If you encounter the Trickster Spider,
please be wary of traps.

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:43.792
Do not engage. Withdraw as quickly as possible.

00:01:43.792 --> 00:01:45.332
- Yes.
- Understood.

00:01:45.332 --> 00:01:48.167
Fran, wait for me!

00:01:51.457 --> 00:01:53.042
Fran,

00:01:53.042 --> 00:01:55.542
hang in there! I'll find you!

00:01:55.542 --> 00:01:56.957
Where do we start?

00:01:56.957 --> 00:01:58.292
Should we return to the fifth floor?

00:01:58.292 --> 00:01:59.917
Shouldn't they be somewhere
deeper in the dungeon?

00:02:02.082 --> 00:02:04.917
I can't even detect any presence,
much less traps.

00:02:04.917 --> 00:02:07.082
Looks like they're not in the southeast...

00:02:07.082 --> 00:02:09.625
Which part of the dungeon should we search then...?

00:02:12.582 --> 00:02:15.625
Wind Magic. Noise Collect.

00:02:24.292 --> 00:02:27.042
The spiders are everywhere.

00:02:27.042 --> 00:02:30.125
It's indeed hard to locate them
while inside the dungeon...

00:02:30.125 --> 00:02:33.667
I can't pick up any sounds
that belong to Fran at all.

00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:37.667
Magic that can pick up sounds
through airflow, huh?

00:02:37.667 --> 00:02:41.957
I've used all my detection skills,
but I can't find anything either!

00:02:41.957 --> 00:02:44.042
This is looking really bad...

00:02:44.042 --> 00:02:46.292
Fran has no weapons,

00:02:46.292 --> 00:02:48.500
and she can't use skills or magic!

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:52.457
Her stats must also have plummeted!

00:02:52.457 --> 00:02:55.707
She can't fight in her current state!

00:02:55.707 --> 00:02:57.582
Not a single trace.

00:02:57.582 --> 00:03:00.500
Didn't they say someone got
teleported into a wall once?

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:01.500
Stop that.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:03.375
That's not helping!

00:03:03.375 --> 00:03:05.500
Now, now, don't argue...

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:06.792
Damn it!

00:03:06.792 --> 00:03:08.792
- This place is massive! There's no end to it!
- Krad, calm down!

00:03:08.792 --> 00:03:09.917
Calm down.

00:03:09.917 --> 00:03:13.250
There might be other
troublesome traps to deal with...

00:03:22.375 --> 00:03:23.667
Damn it!

00:03:23.667 --> 00:03:26.625
I told Fran that I'd do something to save her but...!

00:03:27.667 --> 00:03:30.042
Isn't there anything I can do?

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:35.082
There must be a skill I can use to find her!

00:03:35.082 --> 00:03:39.292
Think! Think…

00:03:48.042 --> 00:03:54.457
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:05:13.541 --> 00:05:14.899
(Episode 11 Summoning the Demon Wolf)

00:05:14.899 --> 00:05:16.750
(Episode 11 Summoning the Demon Wolf)
Of all the skills I have,

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:17.958
there must be something helpful!

00:05:17.958 --> 00:05:20.000
Did I miss anything?

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.500
There has to be some skill for this situation!

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:24.916
Think!

00:05:24.916 --> 00:05:28.916
That's it! If I use Parallel Thought...

00:05:30.375 --> 00:05:32.833
- Anything!
- I took in all the skills I could get,

00:05:32.833 --> 00:05:34.125
- Any skill that can help me!
- so I've got a bunch of skills but...

00:05:34.125 --> 00:05:38.458
-to use… Something I missed...
- Kin Summon?

00:05:38.458 --> 00:05:40.583
The skill from the Army Beetle Leader...

00:05:40.583 --> 00:05:42.416
Kin Summon?

00:05:42.416 --> 00:05:45.125
If I can summon a familiar
that is able to find her...

00:05:45.125 --> 00:05:48.416
Ah, why am I so useless?

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:53.833
But if I use a summoning skill here,
Amanda will definitely notice.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.583
No! There's no time to worry about that!

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.791
Fran comes first!

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:07.333
What kind of familiar can I summon,

00:06:07.333 --> 00:06:08.541
Announcer?

00:06:08.541 --> 00:06:11.958
Available summon, wolf beast.

00:06:11.958 --> 00:06:13.333
A wolf beast?

00:06:13.333 --> 00:06:17.500
Grey Wolf, Ruby Wolf, Thunder Wolf,

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:20.000
- Emerald Wolf…
- That's too many! That's enough!

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:23.541
Which wolf can help me find Fran?

00:06:23.541 --> 00:06:27.916
A wolf with the Life Detection skill,
the Onyx Wolf.

00:06:27.916 --> 00:06:30.500
That's it! That's the one!

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:31.708
All right. Let's do this!

00:06:31.708 --> 00:06:33.625
I'll channel all my mana into that wolf

00:06:33.625 --> 00:06:37.125
so it can find Fran at once!

00:06:39.583 --> 00:06:42.208
What? Summoning Magic?

00:06:42.208 --> 00:06:43.791
Come. Heed my call!

00:06:43.791 --> 00:06:45.583
Use your powers to find Fran!

00:06:45.583 --> 00:06:46.750
(Summon, Onyx Wolf)

00:06:48.083 --> 00:06:49.375
Summon!

00:06:49.375 --> 00:06:51.500
Onyx Wolf!

00:06:55.958 --> 00:06:58.750
This is... an Onyx Wolf!

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:02.333
What's going on? Who summoned it?

00:07:02.333 --> 00:07:06.500
Onyx Wolf, hurry and sniff out Fran...

00:07:09.958 --> 00:07:12.125
Hey! Did you hear what I said?

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:14.916
Hey!

00:07:14.916 --> 00:07:17.583
Darkness Magic... This is bad.

00:07:18.791 --> 00:07:19.875
Wait…

00:07:22.083 --> 00:07:23.541
What?

00:07:26.875 --> 00:07:29.666
It's attacking another target.

00:07:29.666 --> 00:07:31.958
It's not a monster created by this dungeon?

00:07:31.958 --> 00:07:33.458
No matter what,
it's too dangerous to leave it be.

00:07:33.458 --> 00:07:34.583
I must take care of it.

00:07:34.583 --> 00:07:35.916
Wait!

00:07:37.041 --> 00:07:40.000
This is a familiar I summoned!

00:07:41.583 --> 00:07:43.250
Telepathy?

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:44.708
Who are you?

00:07:44.708 --> 00:07:47.416
I'm sorry, I can't explain right now...

00:07:47.416 --> 00:07:50.250
I can only ask you to trust me.

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:52.625
I am Fran's companion!

00:07:52.625 --> 00:07:53.958
Fran's companion?

00:07:53.958 --> 00:07:58.333
Yes. I need its power to find Fran,

00:07:58.333 --> 00:08:00.416
so please don't take it out!

00:08:00.416 --> 00:08:01.583
Okay.

00:08:01.583 --> 00:08:04.125
I don't know who you are, but I understand.

00:08:04.125 --> 00:08:05.916
I'll leave it to you, then.

00:08:05.916 --> 00:08:07.583
Yes.

00:08:07.583 --> 00:08:10.791
But still,
what am I supposed to do about this thing?

00:08:11.791 --> 00:08:15.916
The Onyx Wolf is most likely in berserk mode
due to excessive mana.

00:08:15.916 --> 00:08:18.208
Huh? What does that mean?

00:08:18.208 --> 00:08:22.083
It is the result of channeling more mana
than recommended during the summoning,

00:08:22.083 --> 00:08:25.583
exceeding what the crystal located in its heart
is capable of withstanding,

00:08:25.583 --> 00:08:29.875
causing the mana
inside the Onyx Wolf to run amok.

00:08:29.875 --> 00:08:32.332
That means...

00:08:32.332 --> 00:08:37.750
It believes its "Master"
is the cause of its suffering.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:41.292
No way... Is it in pain?

00:08:41.292 --> 00:08:43.167
I've done something bad...

00:08:43.167 --> 00:08:45.042
What should I do now?

00:08:45.042 --> 00:08:46.750
Might I interrupt?

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.957
You said you summoned the wolf, yes?

00:08:49.957 --> 00:08:51.625
Yes...

00:08:51.625 --> 00:08:54.750
Have you given it a name yet?

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:56.082
A name?

00:08:56.082 --> 00:08:57.457
I've only heard about this,

00:08:57.457 --> 00:09:00.125
so I don't know the exact details,

00:09:00.125 --> 00:09:04.332
but in this world,
gods will give items and monsters names

00:09:04.332 --> 00:09:07.375
and imbue special powers into them.

00:09:07.375 --> 00:09:10.375
To imitate that process,

00:09:10.375 --> 00:09:13.707
summoners will often name
the monsters and spirits they summon

00:09:13.707 --> 00:09:16.542
to strengthen their bond.

00:09:16.542 --> 00:09:21.917
So this is like "named items"
and "named monsters" in games.

00:09:21.917 --> 00:09:24.375
Announcer, is this true?

00:09:24.375 --> 00:09:28.917
The chance of pacifying the wolf
through naming is 93%.

00:09:28.917 --> 00:09:29.917
I see.

00:09:29.917 --> 00:09:32.625
All right. That's what I have to do, then.

00:09:32.625 --> 00:09:35.292
A name for this guy, huh?

00:09:35.292 --> 00:09:37.917
I have to come up with a name on the spot,
so I hope you don't blame me.

00:09:37.917 --> 00:09:39.250
Let's see...

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:41.582
You're a wolf, and you're dark in color...

00:09:41.582 --> 00:09:42.917
All right.

00:09:42.917 --> 00:09:47.207
You are the one I summoned
with my mana for Fran's sake...

00:09:47.207 --> 00:09:49.792
Urushi, the Darkness Wolf!

00:09:52.125 --> 00:09:54.792
Listen to me, Urushi!

00:10:06.167 --> 00:10:07.457
Is it working?

00:10:07.457 --> 00:10:09.250
Status report.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:12.457
Mana optimization through naming

00:10:12.457 --> 00:10:14.792
was successful.

00:10:14.792 --> 00:10:18.207
Currently using surplus mana
to evolve its crystal.

00:10:18.207 --> 00:10:21.875
Complete. All stats have been increased.

00:10:21.875 --> 00:10:23.875
Requirements met.

00:10:23.875 --> 00:10:26.250
Urushi is evolving.

00:10:26.917 --> 00:10:28.500
For real?

00:10:32.332 --> 00:10:33.792
(Urushi, The Darkness Wolf)

00:10:33.792 --> 00:10:34.707
This is…

00:10:34.707 --> 00:10:35.875
It's huge!

00:10:35.875 --> 00:10:38.542
Let's see... Darkness Wolf.

00:10:38.542 --> 00:10:41.792
It has a variety of skills,
and its mana stats are similar to mine.

00:10:41.792 --> 00:10:43.582
(Unique Skill: Prey Absorption)
All I did was give it a name,

00:10:43.582 --> 00:10:45.707
(Titles: Kin of Sword, Kin of Wolf God)
and it's so different now.

00:10:45.707 --> 00:10:48.707
(A Dark-Type)
Fran lost her name when she was enslaved too.

00:10:48.707 --> 00:10:50.082
(Supreme Wolf Monster)
It seems like names possess

00:10:50.082 --> 00:10:53.207
(Threat Level C)
special and magical meanings in this world.

00:10:53.207 --> 00:10:54.625
Okay. Urushi.

00:10:54.625 --> 00:10:57.457
Can you understand me?

00:10:57.457 --> 00:10:59.250
Good, good.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:02.500
Remember the scent
of my wielder, Fran, and find her!

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:12.750
Teacher…

00:11:14.082 --> 00:11:15.457
Did you find her?

00:11:15.457 --> 00:11:17.250
All right! Go, Urushi!

00:11:19.875 --> 00:11:22.582
Wait! Are you going to charge into that?

00:11:26.542 --> 00:11:28.957
(Skill: Shadow Walk)

00:11:28.957 --> 00:11:30.167
This skill!

00:11:30.167 --> 00:11:33.625
Is it just like the one the Greater Demon used?

00:11:33.625 --> 00:11:36.042
Wait! Are you just leaving me here?

00:11:36.042 --> 00:11:37.625
Sorry!

00:11:37.625 --> 00:11:40.957
I've got everything under control!
You can follow us!

00:11:40.957 --> 00:11:42.042
Good grief!

00:11:43.417 --> 00:11:45.417
Wait for me!

00:11:45.417 --> 00:11:47.750
I will find you,

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:49.750
Fran!

00:11:51.957 --> 00:11:54.957
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:11:54.957 --> 00:11:57.167
It's deadly poison…

00:11:57.167 --> 00:12:00.832
My body is not listening to me...

00:12:00.832 --> 00:12:06.292
I'm too weak without any skills...

00:12:06.292 --> 00:12:09.750
Just like before I met Teacher…

00:12:10.875 --> 00:12:14.082
I was nothing... couldn't do anything...

00:12:14.082 --> 00:12:16.082
and weak…

00:12:18.832 --> 00:12:20.750
The… The spiderlings!

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:21.625
Stay away!

00:12:21.625 --> 00:12:23.832
We're not food!

00:12:23.832 --> 00:12:25.457
We're doomed!

00:12:25.457 --> 00:12:27.792
We don't have our weapons...

00:12:27.792 --> 00:12:30.042
I can't fight back…

00:12:37.792 --> 00:12:39.875
Teacher…

00:12:49.832 --> 00:12:51.207
Fran,

00:12:53.875 --> 00:12:56.417
you will not lose.

00:12:56.417 --> 00:12:58.250
I promise you!

00:13:13.167 --> 00:13:16.292
I still have my arms and legs!

00:13:19.625 --> 00:13:21.250
Don't... don't overdo it!

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:23.207
You've been poisoned too!

00:13:27.582 --> 00:13:29.542
I can still fight…

00:13:29.542 --> 00:13:32.250
I have my Teacher's teachings

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:34.292
and this body!

00:13:36.974 --> 00:13:38.515
I am Fran!

00:13:38.667 --> 00:13:41.332
A Black Cat who will evolve!

00:13:43.625 --> 00:13:45.750
Are we not there yet, Urushi?

00:13:46.332 --> 00:13:47.750
There might be traps

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:50.042
in the air and under the floor up ahead!

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:52.417
(Darkness Magic, Trap Vision)

00:13:57.582 --> 00:14:00.750
Using Darkness Magic and Midair Jump
to dodge the traps?

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:02.832
You're brilliant, Urushi!

00:14:10.125 --> 00:14:12.542
Are you certain they're here?

00:14:12.542 --> 00:14:15.375
It's a dead end, but it looks like this is it.

00:14:15.375 --> 00:14:17.582
Stand back, doggy.

00:14:18.792 --> 00:14:20.542
Wind Magic.

00:14:22.957 --> 00:14:24.832
Tornado Lance!

00:14:28.792 --> 00:14:30.375
It's a secret passage!

00:14:30.375 --> 00:14:32.667
It's covered with web.

00:14:32.667 --> 00:14:36.542
We'll only get tangled up
if we try to pass through it.

00:14:37.792 --> 00:14:39.375
I'll clear the path.

00:14:47.917 --> 00:14:49.707
That girl…

00:14:50.457 --> 00:14:53.167
She has been distracting the big spider.

00:14:53.167 --> 00:14:55.542
Is she trying to keep her away from us?

00:14:56.957 --> 00:14:58.542
I can do it…

00:15:02.292 --> 00:15:04.000
I can do this...

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.582
I am Fran...

00:15:05.582 --> 00:15:08.457
The Fran that will make Teacher…

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:12.375
proud!

00:15:14.917 --> 00:15:18.042
Telekinesis-Catapult won't be enough.

00:15:18.042 --> 00:15:20.667
I'll get tangled in the webs.

00:15:20.667 --> 00:15:23.625
No... I can't stop!

00:15:26.875 --> 00:15:29.332
Elemental Sword, Fire!

00:15:30.167 --> 00:15:31.750
All my mana!

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:34.000
My legs must not rest!

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:36.375
Limits…

00:15:36.375 --> 00:15:38.207
are meant to be surpassed!

00:15:39.457 --> 00:15:42.500
I am Teacher's student,

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.000
Fran!

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:00.125
Fran!

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.167
Are... Are you all right?

00:16:04.167 --> 00:16:06.832
T... Teacher...

00:16:06.832 --> 00:16:07.957
Teacher!

00:16:07.957 --> 00:16:09.707
You're hurt!

00:16:09.707 --> 00:16:11.875
And poisoned too! I'll heal you right away!

00:16:11.875 --> 00:16:13.582
Let's take care of that huge spider first.

00:16:13.582 --> 00:16:15.250
Okay. Leave it to me!

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:16.542
Huh?

00:16:16.542 --> 00:16:18.000
Did it run off?

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.582
We'll go after it later.

00:16:19.582 --> 00:16:21.625
Let's get you healed up first.

00:16:21.625 --> 00:16:23.082
Greater Heal!

00:16:23.082 --> 00:16:24.625
Antidote!

00:16:26.832 --> 00:16:28.875
Thank you!

00:16:28.875 --> 00:16:30.832
I'm sorry, Fran.

00:16:30.832 --> 00:16:33.667
I said I'd do something
but it got teleported away after all...

00:16:35.125 --> 00:16:38.625
Teacher has done something to save me!

00:16:38.625 --> 00:16:41.832
Fran, the heat due to Elemental Sword is still...

00:16:41.832 --> 00:16:43.917
It's fine.

00:16:43.917 --> 00:16:46.167
Teacher took a lot of damage too...

00:16:46.167 --> 00:16:49.417
It's nothing compared to what you've endured...

00:16:49.417 --> 00:16:52.167
You've done so well on your own.

00:16:52.167 --> 00:16:55.375
You're my proudest student, Fran.

00:17:02.732 --> 00:17:04.607
Fran!

00:17:08.916 --> 00:17:10.958
I'm so glad you're all right!

00:17:10.958 --> 00:17:13.208
Mama was so worried...

00:17:13.208 --> 00:17:14.875
You're not my mama...

00:17:14.875 --> 00:17:17.541
I'm so glad...

00:17:17.541 --> 00:17:19.208
Thank you, too, Amanda.

00:17:19.208 --> 00:17:21.791
Fran!

00:17:31.125 --> 00:17:33.041
Oh, right. This fluffy thing is a familiar

00:17:33.041 --> 00:17:35.875
I summoned using Kin Summon. Its name is Urushi.

00:17:35.875 --> 00:17:37.583
Urushi?

00:17:37.583 --> 00:17:40.166
It's kind of like your little brother.

00:17:40.166 --> 00:17:43.916
It did its best to look for you.

00:17:43.916 --> 00:17:47.166
Little brother... Fluffy...

00:17:48.333 --> 00:17:51.083
Thank you, Fluffy Urushi.

00:17:52.833 --> 00:17:54.833
That reminds me…

00:17:54.833 --> 00:17:58.291
Now that everything is out of the way...

00:17:58.291 --> 00:18:00.750
Just who are you, Sword?

00:18:02.458 --> 00:18:04.166
Well, I knew this was coming...

00:18:04.166 --> 00:18:06.916
I gave up pretending halfway, after all...

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:12.125
I'm sorry. Pretend I never asked.

00:18:12.125 --> 00:18:14.333
I couldn't help but be curious.

00:18:14.333 --> 00:18:17.208
But I don't want
to make things difficult for Fran.

00:18:17.208 --> 00:18:22.750
It's inappropriate to pry
into another adventurer's skills and equipment.

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:25.500
Unless it's someone you trust very much…

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:29.208
I trust Amanda.

00:18:30.791 --> 00:18:34.416
Teacher, I want to tell Amanda about you.

00:18:34.416 --> 00:18:35.666
Fran...

00:18:35.666 --> 00:18:38.250
Can I?

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:41.791
Well, Amanda certainly
doesn't seem like someone bad...

00:18:41.791 --> 00:18:44.416
But these two have gotten quite close.

00:18:44.416 --> 00:18:46.583
I feel a little left out...

00:18:46.583 --> 00:18:51.583
But I suppose it's a good thing
that Fran has found another person she can trust.

00:18:51.583 --> 00:18:53.625
I understand. Go ahead.

00:18:53.625 --> 00:18:55.666
Thank you, Teacher.

00:18:56.291 --> 00:18:58.708
Um, Amanda...

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:06.000
An intelligence weapon, you say?

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.791
It actually exists!

00:19:07.791 --> 00:19:10.583
I can't believe I actually met one
with my own very eyes!

00:19:10.583 --> 00:19:13.208
A magical sword
that can absorb crystals from monsters

00:19:13.208 --> 00:19:17.875
and gain its skills and share them with Fran!

00:19:17.875 --> 00:19:19.375
Yes...

00:19:19.375 --> 00:19:20.708
This is amazing!

00:19:20.708 --> 00:19:22.083
I can't even describe how I'm feeling...

00:19:22.083 --> 00:19:24.125
Yes.

00:19:24.125 --> 00:19:27.000
Teacher is a super-duper sword!

00:19:27.916 --> 00:19:30.958
A super-duper sword!

00:19:30.958 --> 00:19:34.250
I knew Amanda would accept your existence.

00:19:35.708 --> 00:19:38.916
You are Fran's companion, yes, Mr. Teacher?

00:19:38.916 --> 00:19:41.875
Yes. Without question.

00:19:41.875 --> 00:19:44.666
I'm a little jealous…

00:19:44.666 --> 00:19:47.541
But it's nice to meet you, Mr. Teacher.

00:19:47.541 --> 00:19:50.166
Same here. And just Teacher is fine.

00:19:50.166 --> 00:19:52.666
You may call me Amanda, too, then.

00:19:54.291 --> 00:19:56.208
But more importantly,

00:19:56.208 --> 00:20:00.500
Fran trusts me enough to tell me her secret!

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:03.083
That makes me so happy!

00:20:03.083 --> 00:20:05.166
Thank you…

00:20:05.166 --> 00:20:06.666
Goodness...

00:20:08.791 --> 00:20:11.666
Now, then,
we have to head back to Cruise and the others.

00:20:11.666 --> 00:20:15.583
We agreed to split up to search
and regroup at the plaza on the sixth floor.

00:20:15.583 --> 00:20:16.708
(Bart, Victor, Status: Deadly Poison)
Oh, right!

00:20:16.708 --> 00:20:17.666
(Bart, Victor, Status: Deadly Poison)
Forgot about them.

00:20:17.666 --> 00:20:19.375
They're dying!

00:20:20.041 --> 00:20:23.125
Antidote. Greater Heal.

00:20:26.375 --> 00:20:29.666
My dead pet was waving at me…

00:20:30.916 --> 00:20:31.666
A goddess!

00:20:31.666 --> 00:20:32.625
The holy maiden!

00:20:32.625 --> 00:20:34.041
Worship her!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.666
That was a close call.
Do you remember what happened?

00:20:37.666 --> 00:20:38.666
Well...

00:20:38.666 --> 00:20:43.541
I remember the little girl
fighting and protecting us...

00:20:43.541 --> 00:20:46.250
Then we fainted because of the poison...

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:48.041
Good to hear.

00:20:48.041 --> 00:20:49.250
What's the matter?

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:51.708
If they had overheard Fran and Teacher's secret,

00:20:51.708 --> 00:20:54.875
I was going to use force
to ensure they lost their memories.

00:20:54.875 --> 00:20:56.500
Scary...

00:21:01.708 --> 00:21:04.458
Um...

00:21:04.458 --> 00:21:06.541
This monster…

00:21:06.541 --> 00:21:10.166
Urushi won't eat me, you're sure about that?

00:21:10.166 --> 00:21:13.500
I can leave you here
if you've got any complaints.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.750
Sorry!

00:21:15.416 --> 00:21:17.833
Um... Miss Amanda...

00:21:17.833 --> 00:21:19.500
This is kind of embarrassing...

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:21.875
Recover and walk by yourself, then!

00:21:21.875 --> 00:21:23.458
Sorry!

00:21:26.583 --> 00:21:28.458
There's no one here.

00:21:28.458 --> 00:21:29.916
They're taking too long.

00:21:29.916 --> 00:21:31.625
Maybe something happened.

00:21:31.625 --> 00:21:33.208
Should we look for them?

00:21:33.208 --> 00:21:34.666
Well...

00:21:34.666 --> 00:21:36.833
Urushi can probably find them.

00:21:45.833 --> 00:21:47.208
Teacher!

00:21:47.208 --> 00:21:48.750
You sensed that, too, huh?

00:21:50.833 --> 00:21:53.125
Over there! The light!

00:21:53.125 --> 00:21:56.083
This magic power means…

00:21:58.666 --> 00:22:00.166
A monster?

00:22:01.458 --> 00:22:03.125
A new character?

00:23:34.375 --> 00:23:40.083
(Next Episode
Fran Is Looking Forward to a New Adventure)
